    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_elements_1_1_bulk_viscosity_1_1_coefficients" kindref="compound">Coefficients</ref> of the artificial bulk viscosity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both are dimensionless and default to zero, i.e. inactive. <formula id="45">$b_1 = 0.06$</formula>, <formula id="46">$b_2 = 1.2$</formula> are the values Abaqus/Explicit applies <ndash/> a common choice, not the default, and a recommendation rather than a physical parameter: <formula id="47">$b_1$</formula> is sized to damp the mesh&apos;s highest resolvable frequency, not to model dissipation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
